                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "WxW3a",
                  "name": "Content Area",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 20,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ATPY1",
                      "name": "contentTitle",
                      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "【校园爽文】他被全班嘲笑是废物，三个月后...",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "Plus Jakarta Sans",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N4gq2",
                      "name": "paragraph1",
                      "fill": "#E4E4E7",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "林浩站在教室门口，听着里面传来的嘲笑声。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "CGEW7",
                      "name": "paragraph2",
                      "fill": "#E4E4E7",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "「就他？还想考重点大学？别做梦了！」班长王凯的声音格外刺耳。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rVbg8",
                      "name": "paragraph3",
                      "fill": "#E4E4E7",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "「听说他上学期期末考试，全年级倒数第一，简直是我们班的耻辱。」",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "TwLQh",
                      "name": "paragraph4",
                      "fill": "#E4E4E7",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "林浩握紧了拳头，指甲深深嵌入掌心。他没有推门进去，而是转身离开。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "dnOCE",
                      "name": "paragraph5",
                      "fill": "#E4E4E7",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "三个月后的月考，当成绩公布的那一刻，整个教室鸦雀无声。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "UhOGs",
                      "name": "paragraph6",
                      "fill": "#8B5CF6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "「全年级第一...林浩？！」",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
